      "description": "Real per-container CPU consumption, scoped to whichever stack $environment selects (recon-observability itself included when that's the selection). Added to make Dev/Stage's shared-laptop CPU contention visible during a k6 run instead of inferred -- see compose.observability.yaml's own cadvisor comment. Shown in cores, not percent: rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total) is fractional cores consumed per second and 'percent of what' is ambiguous on a multi-core host, so cores is the conventional cAdvisor unit.",
